WEBVTT

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:10.980
SWORD GAI

00:01:12.150 --> 00:01:14.650
<i>Why are humans drawn to weapons?</i>

00:01:15.570 --> 00:01:17.990
<i>Why are weapons so beautiful?</i>

00:01:19.070 --> 00:01:23.540
<i>Does the penitence of killing someone
<i>grant beauty to the weapon?</i></i>

00:01:24.290 --> 00:01:30.630
<i>Or is beauty required to turn the moment
<i>of a kill into a ceremony?</i></i>

00:01:31.380 --> 00:01:34.090
<i>Even if people die, weapons will remain.</i>

00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:40.350
<i>Within an eternity,
<i>at times weapons will come to hold a life.</i></i>

00:01:56.950 --> 00:02:00.870
You're sure this is the place, Boss?

00:02:00.950 --> 00:02:03.200
We're only finding stones.

00:02:03.700 --> 00:02:08.120
Don't worry. The client
wouldn't throw their money away.

00:02:08.210 --> 00:02:12.880
We'll find it,
a treasure you can't even imagine.

00:02:12.960 --> 00:02:16.720
Is it worth that much?
It's just one sword.

00:02:17.840 --> 00:02:19.590
The Demon Sword Zsoltgewinn.

00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:25.470
It's not just a sword. It's said that
whoever holds it gains great power.

00:02:33.980 --> 00:02:35.860
It's so hot.

00:02:36.690 --> 00:02:38.490
This is bad for my skin.

00:02:38.570 --> 00:02:40.700
We're 15 km from our destination.

00:02:42.160 --> 00:02:43.330
It's almost time.

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:47.500
It won't be long before we meet
the Demon Sword Zsoltgewinn.

00:02:48.660 --> 00:02:50.710
It's not that big a deal, is it?

00:02:50.790 --> 00:02:53.250
Demon swords, holy swords,
enchanted swords,

00:02:53.340 --> 00:02:55.500
how many of them do you really need?

00:02:55.920 --> 00:02:58.920
If an administrator
is joining the mission personally,

00:02:59.050 --> 00:03:00.760
is it that powerful a weapon?

00:03:01.470 --> 00:03:06.390
If legendary weapons had a hierarchy,
Zsoltgewinn would be at the top.

00:03:06.930 --> 00:03:10.270
It was supposedly forged
using the blood of 1,000 demons.

00:03:10.730 --> 00:03:11.940
Demons, huh?

00:03:12.020 --> 00:03:14.230
Better be careful, Administrator Miura.

00:03:14.650 --> 00:03:17.440
Get attached to a weapon
and a demon dwells in you.

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:20.490
Make sure you don't end up
as the 1,001st demon.

00:03:27.410 --> 00:03:28.910
The blood of demons?

00:03:29.450 --> 00:03:30.710
Really?

00:03:30.790 --> 00:03:33.920
I don't know. That's just how legends are.

00:03:34.540 --> 00:03:36.500
It's an old story, after all.

00:03:36.710 --> 00:03:40.300
From the Roman era, supposedly,
so it's likely 2,000 years old.

00:03:42.050 --> 00:03:46.930
They say barbarians suddenly attacked
a tiny village outside the Roman empire.

00:03:48.140 --> 00:03:52.890
The village wasn't prepared at all
and was quickly overrun by the barbarians.

00:03:52.980 --> 00:03:54.940
Women, children, even the elderly.

00:03:55.860 --> 00:04:01.450
The village priests prayed to the gods
for aid. But the gods were silent.

00:04:02.740 --> 00:04:05.450
So they turned to a demon instead.

00:04:05.530 --> 00:04:09.620
They sacrificed the village's sheep,
and prayed feverishly to the demon.

00:04:10.410 --> 00:04:12.460
And the demon answered them.

00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:16.960
It answered their prayers
and sent a lone knight.

00:04:17.630 --> 00:04:21.550
The weapon this skull knight wielded
was the sword Zsoltgewinn.

00:04:22.340 --> 00:04:25.890
When the knight drew Zsoltgewinn
by its hilt,

00:04:25.970 --> 00:04:28.140
some say it howled like a beast.

00:04:34.060 --> 00:04:36.310
The battle was over in an instant.

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:40.480
The evil aura from Zsoltgewinn
attacked the barbarians.

00:04:46.490 --> 00:04:49.490
The villagers offered prayers of thanks
to the knight.

00:04:50.330 --> 00:04:55.290
But the priests had forgotten
that they'd prayed not to the gods,

00:04:56.630 --> 00:04:57.790
but to a demon.

00:04:59.340 --> 00:05:01.800
The knight had not come
to save the village.

00:05:03.670 --> 00:05:06.550
It came to destroy all life.

00:05:12.640 --> 00:05:14.430
What an awful story.

00:05:14.770 --> 00:05:18.190
Are we safe digging up
something so dangerous?

00:05:19.270 --> 00:05:21.440
Don't worry. It's just a legend.

00:05:22.110 --> 00:05:24.240
We just need to do our jobs.

00:05:24.320 --> 00:05:26.450
Boss, please come here!

00:05:35.540 --> 00:05:36.500
Graves?

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:38.920
Looks like catacombs.

00:05:40.380 --> 00:05:41.630
Boss, look!

00:05:56.480 --> 00:05:57.770
This has to be it.

00:05:58.730 --> 00:06:00.060
Zsoltgewinn!

00:06:13.450 --> 00:06:14.490
Halt!

00:06:19.330 --> 00:06:21.000
Who are you?

00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:23.340
We are with the Shoshidai.

00:06:23.420 --> 00:06:26.010
We're in charge
of various legendary weapons.

00:06:26.840 --> 00:06:29.510
Give us Zsoltgewinn.

00:06:30.390 --> 00:06:31.970
What're you talking about?

00:06:32.390 --> 00:06:33.260
Get them.

00:06:44.730 --> 00:06:47.280
Boss, it's no good! They're professionals!

00:06:52.990 --> 00:06:55.120
They should've just handed it over.

00:07:12.970 --> 00:07:14.180
Beautiful.

00:07:20.520 --> 00:07:23.360
The dark aura of Zsoltgewinn
swallowed him up, huh?

00:07:23.440 --> 00:07:25.940
Ichijo, get Zsoltgewinn, now!

00:07:57.220 --> 00:07:58.390
Mission complete.

00:08:10.280 --> 00:08:11.650
Beautiful.

00:08:11.740 --> 00:08:14.860
Is it? Looks horrifying to me.

00:08:15.820 --> 00:08:20.620
I can see its victims' faces in the depths
of the light reflecting off the blade.

00:08:22.160 --> 00:08:24.120
That's what makes it beautiful.

00:08:25.420 --> 00:08:26.670
Whatever.

00:08:26.750 --> 00:08:28.880
Good night. I've gotta sleep.

00:08:29.670 --> 00:08:30.510
Ichijo.

00:08:31.630 --> 00:08:34.590
Good work. I hope we meet again.

00:08:35.430 --> 00:08:36.510
I don't know.

00:08:37.010 --> 00:08:39.810
This one feels like
it's going to be a long sleep.

00:09:02.160 --> 00:09:03.120
Don't move!

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:04.410
Give us that weapon!

00:09:07.080 --> 00:09:07.920
Very well.

00:09:16.430 --> 00:09:17.390
Damn it!

00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:45.160
Who's there?

00:09:46.160 --> 00:09:48.460
Who calls me?

00:09:53.670 --> 00:09:58.680
Is it you who calls me, Zsoltgewinn?

00:10:01.810 --> 00:10:04.140
Do you seek me as well?

00:10:05.430 --> 00:10:08.100
Do you feel my love for you?

00:10:10.730 --> 00:10:13.530
Zsoltgewinn, you are so beautiful.

00:10:13.940 --> 00:10:14.780
I want you.

00:10:15.360 --> 00:10:17.280
I want to make you mine.

00:10:32.630 --> 00:10:33.920
Administrator Miura!

00:10:36.880 --> 00:10:38.930
Administrator, n-no.

00:10:47.060 --> 00:10:48.350
Fire!

00:11:31.270 --> 00:11:32.440
I'm back!

00:11:33.230 --> 00:11:35.820
Welcome back! You're home early.

00:11:36.480 --> 00:11:37.610
I was worried.

00:11:38.360 --> 00:11:40.070
Today was your checkup, right?

00:11:40.650 --> 00:11:45.200
It's fine. They said everything's great.
This time next month, you'll be a daddy.

00:11:47.450 --> 00:11:49.200
Is it a boy or a girl?

00:11:49.290 --> 00:11:51.830
Let's ask the doctor, Wakaba!

00:11:52.460 --> 00:11:56.090
No! We decided to keep it a surprise
until the baby's born.

00:11:56.670 --> 00:12:02.340
But that makes it tough to get a present!
Should I buy one for a boy or a girl?

00:12:04.640 --> 00:12:05.470
Here.

00:12:06.680 --> 00:12:07.510
Ta-da.

00:12:07.810 --> 00:12:10.560
Today's gifts. I got one of each!

00:12:11.060 --> 00:12:13.810
Jeez, you always do this.

00:12:14.350 --> 00:12:17.360
Papa is too sweet to you, isn't he?

00:12:31.160 --> 00:12:33.410
You're still crying, Shiryu?

00:12:35.080 --> 00:12:38.170
You seek blood again?

00:12:46.680 --> 00:12:51.560
We will now perform the Hama ritual
to remove the evil aura of the Shiryu.

00:13:34.980 --> 00:13:35.810
Oh no!

00:13:46.450 --> 00:13:47.410
Blood.

00:13:48.280 --> 00:13:49.820
Need more blood.

00:13:50.870 --> 00:13:53.910
The evil... overtook him?

00:14:15.520 --> 00:14:17.140
More blood.

00:14:38.210 --> 00:14:39.420
I'll hold them.

00:14:41.960 --> 00:14:44.500
Pregnant ladies don't carry anything.

00:14:44.880 --> 00:14:46.880
Daddy is so reliable, huh?

00:14:47.800 --> 00:14:50.430
Hey, about the name--

00:14:55.010 --> 00:14:55.850
Takashi?

00:15:05.150 --> 00:15:06.480
Takashi!

00:15:07.030 --> 00:15:10.570
No! No!

00:15:10.950 --> 00:15:14.030
-Takashi! Takashi!
-Blood.

00:15:14.780 --> 00:15:16.580
More blood.

00:15:49.820 --> 00:15:52.820
What am I...

00:15:54.370 --> 00:15:56.410
What am I doing?

00:16:24.940 --> 00:16:25.900
<i>Blood.</i>

00:16:27.020 --> 00:16:29.030
<i>More blood.</i>

00:17:09.520 --> 00:17:10.530
<i>Kill.</i>

00:17:10.940 --> 00:17:15.610
<i>Kill.</i>

00:17:34.300 --> 00:17:35.510
I can't let go.

00:17:37.340 --> 00:17:38.300
My hand...

00:17:39.760 --> 00:17:40.680
My hand...

00:17:42.060 --> 00:17:42.970
<i>Kill.</i>

00:17:43.680 --> 00:17:46.640
<i>More blood.</i>

00:17:53.320 --> 00:17:56.110
No!

00:18:05.830 --> 00:18:10.000
Administrator Miura,
the Shoshidai guarantees your safety.

00:18:10.710 --> 00:18:12.840
Throw down Zsoltgewinn and surrender!

00:18:26.270 --> 00:18:27.730
He's turned into a Busoma!

00:18:27.850 --> 00:18:28.730
Fire! Fire!

00:18:39.160 --> 00:18:43.200
Was it you who called me?

00:18:43.700 --> 00:18:47.710
I called you, and you called me.

00:18:48.160 --> 00:18:54.340
We exist only to fight,
and to seek out stronger foes.

00:18:55.210 --> 00:18:57.210
I am Flamberge.

00:18:57.300 --> 00:18:59.630
I burn all.

00:19:00.300 --> 00:19:02.220
I am Zsoltgewinn.

00:19:02.430 --> 00:19:04.510
I rule over all death.

00:19:55.190 --> 00:19:56.150
Weak.

00:20:21.510 --> 00:20:22.970
How foolish.

00:20:24.090 --> 00:20:25.640
At her age...

00:20:27.220 --> 00:20:29.640
If she lived, she could've been saved.

00:20:41.900 --> 00:20:45.200
What a terrible dark aura this blade has.

00:20:54.870 --> 00:20:57.590
You wish to live, do you not?

00:20:58.630 --> 00:20:59.500
Very well.
